(:adr
  :id "D88"
  :shortcode "D88"
  :title "Full Monorepo Epistemic Closure, Holistic 10-Tier Quality Certification, and Milestone M09 Settle"
  :status :active
  :planStatus :approved
  :date "2026-09-13"
  :cluster "architecture/certification"
  :deciders ["user" "architect" "planner" "implementer" "auditor"]
  :problem "As the monorepo concludes Wave 136 spanning 38 packages, 65+ architectural decisions, and 600+ tasks, fragmented verification criteria risk allowing undetected epistemic drift, ungrounded empirical claims, or fragile edge-case regressions to escape into production milestones. Achieving definitive readiness requires unified 10-tier gate certification and formal cryptographic milestone settlement."
  :drivers [
    "Holistic 10-Tier Verification: Expanding from 7 core gates to 10 comprehensive tiers (including Wasm browser execution, stage-2 compiler bootstrap, and multi-model consensus)."
    "100% Epistemic Grounding: Mechanical validation that every quantitative claim in rules, ADRs, and documentation binds to a verified execution receipt with exact path:line citations."
    "Milestone M09 Settlement: Authoring an immutable cryptographic settlement ledger recording state hashes, wave closures, and invariant conformance."
    "Sovereign Release Certification: Packaging a deterministic, zero-dependency release bundle for autonomous agents and developer tooling."
  ]
  :evidence [
    "Prior audits identified ungrounded claims regarding compaction ratios and SNR thresholds that lacked physical measurement receipts."
    "ADR D81 mandates that empirical claims enter only with measurable definitions and baseline-failing gates."
    "The 7 core verification gates pass cleanly (bin/asl audit gates), providing the foundation for comprehensive 10-tier expansion."
    "Cryptographic ledger sealing prevents retro-active specification modification or regression."
  ]
  :decision "Adopt D88 establishing the Full Monorepo Epistemic Closure and Milestone M09 Settlement in .asl/mem/reviews/M09Settlement.asn and asl/tools/asl.c. Implement the 10-tier verification engine (asl audit closure), certify 100% claim grounding across the monorepo, and execute final cryptographic milestone settlement."
  :invariants ["C1" "C2" "C3" "C4" "D34" "D51" "D52" "D81" "D88"]
  :tasks [
    "Task48901"
    "Task48902"
    "Task48903"
    "Task48904"
    "Task48905"
    "Task48906"
  ]
  :settledChoices [
    (:choice :id verificationScope :value "Holistic 10-tier audit combining syntax, types, tests, bounds, claims, wasm, stage2, and mesh")
    (:choice :id claimRefutation :value "Automated failure on any numerical claim lacking an executed assert receipt")
    (:choice :id settlementFormat :value "Cryptographic digest of all package manifests, task ledgers, and git tree state")
    (:choice :id releasePackaging :value "Single standalone binary and portable WebAssembly bundle with zero dynamic host dependencies")
  ]
  :outcomes [
    "Definitive epistemic closure across all 38 packages and 136 roadmap waves"
    "Zero ungrounded empirical claims or unverified assertions throughout the entire monorepo"
    "100% reproducible green status across all 10 verification tiers"
    "Certified Milestone M09 release ready for general autonomous operation"
  ]
)
